 mm，另有所有观测共用的独立校准 u=0.08 mm．最终 u 多少 mm？</p>","style":"computational","topicIds":["experiment.error-analysis"],"type":"numeric","version":2},{"assets":{},"authors":[{"kind":"ai","name":"Codex"}],"choiceOrder":"fixed","cognitiveLevel":"analyze","conceptIds":["measurement.weighted-measurements"],"contentFingerprint":"sha256:fe96e728c8b156fed8bd6a78c3963ede33a52e8dd318a6393f0057493054b310","difficulty":2,"estimatedSeconds":600,"feedback":{"correctHtml":"<p>用无偏约束 Σaᵢ=1 最小化 Σaᵢ²uᵢ²，求导得 aᵢ∝1/uᵢ² 并归一化；说明独立和已知正方差．</p>","incorrectHtml":"<p>写出方差表达式或逆方差比例，但缺归一化、独立条件或最小化步骤．</p>"},"grading":{"mode":"self_assessed","rubric":[{"id":"incomplete","label":"未建立权系数和为一的约束，或用标准差倒数当权．","points":0},{"id":"partial","label":"写出方差表达式或逆方差比例，但缺归一化、独立条件或最小化步骤．","points":0.5},{"id":"complete","label":"用无偏约束 Σaᵢ=1 最小化 Σaᵢ²uᵢ²，求导得 aᵢ∝1/uᵢ² 并归一化；说明独立和已知正方差．","points":1}]},"hintsHtml":["<p>权取独立方差倒数；先分清已知绝对尺度、相对权和共同校准．</p>"],"id":"q-000150","license":"CC-BY-SA-4.0","objectiveIds":["experiment.error-analysis.weighted-measurements.analysis"],"objectivesDetail":[{"anchor":"course-analysis","id":"experiment.error-analysis.weighted-measurements.analysis","pageId":"experiment.error-analysis.weighted-measurements","pageTitle":"不等精度测量与结果合并","title":"不等精度测量与结果合并：说明方法、结果与限制","url":"../../experiment/error-analysis/weighted-measurements/"}],"provenance":{"ai_assisted":true,"note":"独立编写的误差分析课程训练题；学习范围参考本仓库误差分析讲义及页面所列权威资料，数据与情境自编．","type":"original"},"referenceAnswerHtml":"<p>最小化 Σa_i²u_i²，用乘子得 a_i∝1/u_i²．</p>","relatedPages":["experiment.error-analysis.weighted-measurements"],"relatedPagesDetail":[{"id":"experiment.error-analysis.weighted-measurements","title":"不等精度测量与结果合并","url":"../../experiment/error-analysis/weighted-measurements/"}],"response":{"format":"plain_text","max_chars":12000,"min_chars":1,"placeholder":"写出模型、假设、关键计算及结果解释．","required":true,"rows":6},"solutionHtml":"<p>设独立无偏观测的正方差为 uᵢ²，线性估计为 ΣaᵢXᵢ．无偏性要求 Σaᵢ=1，方差为 Σaᵢ²uᵢ²．构造 F=Σaᵢ²uᵢ²−λ(Σaᵢ−1)，对各 aᵢ 求导得 2aᵢuᵢ²=λ，故 aᵢ 与 1/uᵢ² 成正比．利用系数和为一归一化，得到 aᵢ=uᵢ⁻²/Σⱼuⱼ⁻²，合并方差为 1/Σⱼuⱼ⁻²．此线性最小方差推导不要求正态．</p>","source":{"choices":[],"stemMarkdown":"在约束权系数和为一的条件下推导逆方差加权．"},"status":"published","stemHtml":"<p>在约束权系数和为一的条件下推导逆方差加权．</p>","style":"modeling","topicIds":["experiment.error-analysis"],"type":"free_response","version":3},{"assets":{},"authors":[{"kind":"ai","name":"Codex"}],"choiceOrder":"fixed","cognitiveLevel":"analyze","conceptIds":["measurement.weighted-measurements"],"contentFingerprint":"sha256:94661efb87f30ff4581c6da32279acddbb7277b783ed6e46e85d652bf0efba17","difficulty":2,"estimatedSeconds":600,"feedback":{"correctHtml":"<p>将独立正态密度相乘，取对数并对共同均值求导，令 Σ(xᵢ−μ)/uᵢ²=0，得到归一化逆方差加权均值．</p>","incorrectHtml":"<p>写出对数似然或一阶导数，但未解出逆方差加权均值．</p>"},"grading":{"mode":"self_assessed","rubric":[{"id":"incomplete","label":"把似然直接当成均值参数的概率密度，或未使用独立正态模型．","points":0},{"id":"partial","label":"写出对数似然或一阶导数，但未解出逆方差加权均值．","points":0.5},{"id":"complete","label":"将独立正态密度相乘，取对数并对共同均值求导，令 Σ(xᵢ−μ)/uᵢ²=0，得到归一化逆方差加权均值．","points":1}]},"hintsHtml":["<p>权取独立方差倒数；先分清已知绝对尺度、相对权和共同校准．</p>"],"id":"q-000151","license":"CC-BY-SA-4.0","objectiveIds":["experiment.error-analysis.weighted-measurements.analysis"],"objectivesDetail":[{"anchor":"course-analysis","id":"experiment.error-analysis.weighted-measurements.analysis","pageId":"experiment.error-analysis.weighted-measurements","pageTitle":"不等精度测量与结果合并","title":"不等精度测量与结果合并：说明方法、结果与限制","url":"../../experiment/error-analysis/weighted-measurements/"}],"provenance":{"ai_assisted":true,"note":"独立编写的误差分析课程训练题；学习范围参考本仓库误差分析讲义及页面所列权威资料，数据与情境自编．","type":"original"},"referenceAnswerHtml":"<p>对联合密度取对数并对共同均值求导为零．</p>","relatedPages":["experiment.error-analysis.weighted-measurements"],"relatedPagesDetail":[{"id":"experiment.error-analysis.weighted-measurements","title":"不等精度测量与结果合并","url":"../../experiment/error-analysis/weighted-measurements/"}],"response":{"format":"plain_text","max_chars":12000,"min_chars":1,"placeholder":"写出模型、假设、关键计算及结果解释．","required":true,"rows":6},"solutionHtml":"<p>独立正态观测的联合似然是各正态密度之积，已知方差时，与 μ 有关的对数似然为 −Σ(xᵢ−μ)²/(2uᵢ²) 加常数．对 μ 求导得 Σ(xᵢ−μ)/uᵢ²；令其为零并整理，μ 的估计为 Σ(xᵢ/uᵢ²)/Σ(1/uᵢ²)．二阶导数为 −Σ1/uᵢ²&lt;0，故为极大值．似然是观测数据给定后关于参数的函数，不是参数概率密度．</p>","source":{"choices":[],"stemMarkdown":"怎样从独立正态似然得到同样的加权平均？"},"status":"published","stemHtml":"<p>怎样从独立正态似然得到同样的加权平均？</p>","style":"modeling","topicIds":["experiment.error-analysis"],"type":"free_response","version":3},{"assets":{},"authors":[{"kind":"ai","name":"Codex"}],"choiceOrder":"fixed","cognitiveLevel":"analyze","conceptIds":["measurement.weighted-measurements"],"contentFingerprint":"sha256:4e6186af1b2bdba3fb06bd4772fde76aded826fed34b16972db1f98b620d8d54","difficulty":2,"estimatedSeconds":600,"feedback":{"correctHtml":"<p>得到均值 10.0333 mm、残差平方和 0.0466667 mm²，除以 2 得 0.0233333 mm²，再除以权和 3 并开方得 0.0881917 mm．</p>","incorrectHtml":"<p>求出均值 10.0333 mm，但在残差自由度、单位权方差或除以权和时有遗漏．</p>"},"grading":{"mode":"self_assessed","rubric":[{"id":"incomplete","label":"直接将样本标准差当作均值标准不确定度，或未计算残差．","points":0},{"id":"partial","label":"求出均值 10.0333 mm，但在残差自由度、单位权方差或除以权和时有遗漏．","points":0.5},{"id":"complete","label":"得到均值 10.0333 mm、残差平方和 0.0466667 mm²，除以 2 得 0.0233333 mm²，再除以权和 3 并开方得 0.0881917 mm．","points":1}]},"hintsHtml":["<p>权取独立方差倒数；先分清已知绝对尺度、相对权和共同校准．</p>"],"id":"q-000152","license":"CC-BY-SA-4.0","objectiveIds":["experiment.error-analysis.weighted-measurements.analysis"],"objectivesDetail":[{"anchor":"course-analysis","id":"experiment.error-analysis.weighted-measurements.analysis","pageId":"experiment.error-analysis.weighted-measurements","pageTitle":"不等精度测量与结果合并","title":"不等精度测量与结果合并：说明方法、结果与限制","url":"../../experiment/error-analysis/weighted-measurements/"}],"provenance":{"ai_assisted":true,"note":"独立编写的误差分析课程训练题；学习范围参考本仓库误差分析讲义及页面所列权威资料，数据与情境自编．","type":"original"},"referenceAnswerHtml":"<p>均值 10.033333 mm，s0²=0.0233333 mm²，u=0.0881917 mm．</p>","relatedPages":["experiment.error-analysis.weighted-measurements"],"relatedPagesDetail":[{"id":"experiment.error-analysis.weighted-measurements","title":"不等精度测量与结果合并","url":"../../experiment/error-analysi